/Producer (Powered By Business Objects)
/Title (Computer Architecture for Energy Efficient SFQ)
/Author (Gibson, Jr, Gerald W.)
/Keywords (*COMPLEMENTARY METAL OXIDE SEMICONDUCTORS;*COMPUTER ARCHITECTURE;*SUPERCONDUCTIVITY;COMPUTER LOGIC;EFFICIENCY;ELECTRONICS;ENERGY;HIGH PERFORMANCE COMPUTING;JOSEPHSON JUNCTIONS;LOGIC CIRCUITS;MEMORY DEVICES;METRICS;THREE DIMENSIONAL)
/Subject (This report identifies a candidate architecture for an energy efficient SFQ-based processor unit. It quantitatively analyzes candidates for register and main memory with respect to access time, density and energy efficiency. Finally, it investigates the efficacy of three dimensional integration 3DI for enhancing aerial circuit density.)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/ADA614747.pdf)
>>
endobj
